# L §5.5: an ask's cone holds every axis its run reads; the walk reads a place's leaving rule (L §3.6, §5.14), so an
# axis that only a takes clause's order reads, through rank's rules, forks every ask that reads the place (E §3.3).
# The migrator's F-l (t13, ask qb), cut down: acc gets 200.00 DUK of ania's and 200.00 DUK of tomek's (gifts, by
# donee), then w1 takes 200.00 DUK by rank[k.owner].  ania_first: ania's part goes (0.00, and tomek's 200.00 stays);
# tomek_first: the other way; every figure is a gift's amount carried through, or 0.  Before: REFCORE-NOT-YET axis
# rule_ax read outside the axes the ask reaches.
=== m.tally
model t13
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source src "test"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

kind couples: parties

kind persons: parties

kind gifts_in: transfers
  attr donee: key persons

kind cash_accounts: place one min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(DUK)
  takes k for w order rank[k.owner]

place acc: cash_accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2000-01-01..

input jb: observed

axis rule_ax
  ania_first "assumed"
  tomek_first "assumed"

def rank[p in parties]: int at reader
  rule af = (if p == ania then 0 else 1) when rule_ax == ania_first
  rule tf = (if p == tomek then 0 else 1) when rule_ax == tomek_first

def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule community = (if p == ania_tomek then 1 else 0)
  rule gifted beats community = (if p == m.donee then 1 else 0) when m in gifts_in

ask q: bal(acc, 2025-12-31) of ania, bal(acc, 2025-12-31) of tomek

version cast
  cite src
  known 2021-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1991-03-14..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1989-07-02..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2016-09-10..

version open
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2021-01-01
  opening[acc] = 0 at 2025-01-01 start

version j
  cite src
  governs 2025-01..2025-12
  known 2025-01-01
  covers acc
  jb[g1] = (on: 2025-02-01, kind: gifts_in, leg cash from world to acc amount 200.00 DUK, donee: ania) "g1"
  jb[g2] = (on: 2025-02-01, kind: gifts_in, leg cash from world to acc amount 200.00 DUK, donee: tomek) "g2"
  jb[w1] = (on: 2025-03-01, kind: transfers, leg cash from acc to world amount 200.00 DUK) "w1"
=== expect
q [rule_ax = ania_first]: (0.00 DUK, 200.00 DUK)
  reading: rule_ax = ania_first
  cut 2026-01-15
q [rule_ax = tomek_first]: (200.00 DUK, 0.00 DUK)
  reading: rule_ax = tomek_first
  cut 2026-01-15
